Interactive render delegate edits while the render is paused or stopped, through a UsdImagingGL.Engine, from python

A sphere has its material color changed and is moved while the render is paused, then resumed, or stopped, then
restarted, with PauseRenderer/ResumeRenderer and StopRenderer/RestartRenderer of the engine. The render delegate is
driven by a headless UsdImagingGL.Engine as a viewport does, see testsuite/common/interactive_engine_test.py. Each
render is checked in test.py, and the last one is compared against the reference image.

author: cyril.pichard@autodesk.com

PARAMS: {'script': '"{}" test.py'.format(usd_python)}
